---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="CompareVue privacy policy — what data we collect and how we use it.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: June 10, 2026</p>
    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-gray mt-8 max-w-none">
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you visit comparevue.com, we automatically collect basic usage data including browser type and pages visited. We collect your email address only when you voluntarily subscribe to our newsletter or contact us.</p>
      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use collected information to operate the Site, send newsletters you've opted into, respond to inquiries, and analyze usage to improve our content.</p>
      <h2>Cookies and Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>We may use cookies for site functionality. Some links are affiliate links — our partners may use cookies to track referrals. You can disable cookies in your browser settings.</p>
      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data by contacting us at hello@comparevue.com.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Reach us at <strong>hello@comparevue.com</strong> or visit our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
